{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":15.44},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.04,"end":30.68},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32,"end":42.719}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":4,"text":"早期電池實驗讓持續電流能被實際研究。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.2,"end":8.16,"text":"電源在閉合電路提供電位差。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.52,"end":11.44,"text":"我們把燈簡化成理想電阻負載；"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.08,"end":15.44,"text":"真實 LED 還需要非線性模型。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.04,"end":18.08,"text":"固定電阻 100，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.4,"end":21.6,"text":"比較電壓 0、3、6，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.16,"end":24,"text":"觀察何時沒有電流，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":24.24,"end":26.08,"text":"以及亮度如何變化。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":27.44,"end":30.68,"text":"哪個量驅動電流通過電阻？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32,"end":34.8,"text":"哪個量驅動電流通過電阻？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35.76,"end":39.52,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":40.16,"end":42.719,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}